# Cross-Platform Repository Rules

Follow the cross-platform contract in the repository root `AGENTS.md`.

- Keep Windows and Linux on the same source branch by default.
- Detect the active OS, shell, package manager, display protocol, and tool paths.
- Keep absolute paths and runtime configuration local to each machine.
- Build dependencies and generated output independently on each OS.
- Use portable UTF-8 text, file names, and repository-relative paths.
- Keep platform-specific implementations side by side rather than duplicating
  the repository into long-lived OS branches.
